# Frontend

- UI strings are Chinese. Energy is **能量**, never XP / 经验.
- `src/lib/api.ts` is the only `invoke()` site for pages. It goes through `src/lib/invoke.ts` (Tauri, or `src/lib/preview/` when `VITE_PREVIEW=1`). Do not import `@tauri-apps/api` from a page or component.
- Pages consume view-models from `src/lib/*`; tests colocate as `src/lib/*.test.ts`. Cloud-backup helpers: `src/lib/cloudSync.ts`.
- Run frontend tests with `npx vitest run --dir src` (never unscoped — `.worktrees/` copies inflate counts).
- Colour: `src/index.css` `--cat-*` and `src/lib/theme.ts` (`categoryColor` / `categoryColorAt`). No hex / rgb literals in components. Merge classes with `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts`. Color themes (`colorTheme` in settings) wash the page ground + `--primary`; they must not retint `--cat-*`. Switches follow `--primary`. 默认 is the cool near-white gray (white chip); 暖黄 is the mockup parchment.
- Pages: `Today.tsx` / `Tasks.tsx` / `Stats.tsx` / `Shop.tsx` / `Settings.tsx`. Rail id `week` is the 统计 tab (`src/lib/rail.ts`); id `tasks` is 任务. Do not add FullCalendar, dnd-kit, or Radix.
- Task CRUD / NL input live on 任务. Clicking a list row, calendar block, or Today plan block opens `TaskDetailDialog`. Notes Markdown subset lives in `src/lib/taskNotesMd.ts` and never enters judgment. List drag past 4px removes the source row, inserts a muted ghost gap, and shows a floating `bg-card` card — no dnd-kit. List row chips use `listScheduleChip` (today = clock, 昨天/明天/后天, 周几 / 下周几, else date; overdue/yesterday `text-destructive`, else `text-energy`). The task header is `未完成 n · 今日已排期 …` with coin/energy left of the 3/7-day control; add-group / show-done live on the list blank context menu. Calendar day labels share the grid scroll container (sticky). The Today plan column also shares `TaskActionMenu`, `TaskDateDialog`, edge-resize, and ⌘C/V; it does not create tasks. `TaskActionMenu` starts with a date shortcut row (今天 / 明天 / 下周 / 自定义 / 清除). Today, tomorrow, next week (today+7) and clear apply immediately via `rescheduleTask`; 自定义 still opens `TaskDateDialog` or the detail date popover. Unscheduled shortcuts mint the default 30-minute block. Detail is a compact reading card (schedule summary in the header, no live notes preview). Date editing uses shared `TaskDateCard` as a popover on the detail card and as the standalone 更改日期 panel (`Dialog` `chrome="float"`). Changing start or end date keeps both on the same day until the other date field is edited. No nested Dialog. `Dialog` only auto-focuses the first field when `open` becomes true.
- Settings 「任务通知」 binds `task_notifications` (default off).
- Each page is `<>{PageHeader}{scroll area}</>`. Keep `TRAFFIC_LIGHT_STRIP` / `TOOLBAR_ROW` / `BRAND_ROW` / `TOOLBAR_PAD_BOTTOM` in sync with the sidebar brand block.
- Primitives in `src/components/ui/*` are hand-rolled (no Radix). Blue = primary action (unless a color theme recolors `--primary`), amber = warning, red = destructive only. Switches follow `--primary`.
- Tailwind v4 CSS-first (`@tailwindcss/vite`). No `tailwind.config.*`, no PostCSS. Tokens are bare HSL triplets via `hsl(var(--x))`.
- T15 is not done: 统计 / 商店 / 今日 still read the live DB. Do not pretend wallet numbers come from `merged.db`.
